        type: 3}
      propertyPath: texts.Array.data[4]
      value: "<size=110%>3e. <indent=5%> \uB530\uB77C\uC11C X\uC120\uC774 \uACA9\uC790\uC640
        \uAD50\uD658\uD560 \uC218 \uC788\uB294 \uD5C8\uC6A9\uB41C \uC6B4\uB3D9\uB7C9\uC758
        <b>x</b> \uC131\uBD84\uACFC <b>y</b> \uC131\uBD84\uC740 \uB2E4\uC74C\uACFC
        \uAC19\uB2E4.\r\n<align=center><size=115%><b><i>M<sub>x</sub> = \u03C4h/a</i></b></size>\r\n</align>\uADF8\uB9AC\uACE0\r\n<align=center><size=115%><b><i>M<sub>y</sub>
        = \u03C4'h/b</i></b></size>\r\n</align>\uC5EC\uAE30\uC11C <b>\u03C4</b>\uC640
        <b>\u03C4'</b>\uB294 \uC815\uC218 \uC0C1\uC218\uC774\uB2E4.\r\n\uACB0\uACFC\uC801\uC73C\uB85C,
        \uC785\uC0AC X\uC120\uACFC \uC0B0\uB780\uB41C X\uC120 \uC0AC\uC774\uC758
        \uAC01\uB3C4 \uBCC0\uD654\uB294 \uB2E4\uC74C \uC2DD\uC744 \uB9CC\uC871\uD574\uC57C
        \uD55C\uB2E4.\r\n<align=center><size=115%><b><i>hf/c(cos(\u03B8)-cos(\u03B8'))
        = \u03C4h/a</i></b>\r\n</size></align>\uADF8\uB9AC\uACE0\r\n<align=center><size=115%><b><i>hf/c(sin(\u03B8)-sin(\u03B8'))
        = \u03C4'h/b</i></b>\r\n</size></align>"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 376331665047565982, guid: 1f43928e7eb37c04284d31a83a66f4c8,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: texts.Array.data[5]
      value: "3e. <indent=5%> Consequentemente, as componentes <b>x</b> e <b>y</b>
        dos impulsos permitidos que o raio X pode trocar com a rede cristalina s\xE3o:\r\n<align=center><size=115%><b><i>M<sub>x</sub>
        = \u03C4h/a</b></i></size>\r\n</align>e\r\n<align=center><size=115%><b><i>M<sub>y</sub>
        = \u03C4'h/b</b></i></size>\r\n</align>onde <b>\u03C4</b> e <b>\u03C4'</b>
        s\xE3o constantes inteiras.\r\nPor conseguinte, a varia\xE7\xE3o no \xE2ngulo
        entre os raios incidente e emergente deve satisfazer:\r\n<align=center><size=115%><b><i>hf/c(cos(\u03B8)-cos(\u03B8'))
        = \u03C4h/a</i></b>\r\n</size></align>e\r\n<align=center><b><size=115%><i>hf/c(sin(\u03B8)-sin(\u03B8'))
        = \u03C4'h/b</i></b>\r\n</size></align>"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 376331665047565982, guid: 1f43928e7eb37c04284d31a83a66f4c8,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: texts.Array.data[6]
      value: "3e. <indent=5%> Par cons\xE9quent, les composantes <b>x</b> et <b>y</b>
        des impulsions autoris\xE9es que le rayon X peut \xE9changer avec le r\xE9seau
        cristallin sont :\r\n<align=center><size=115%><b><i>M<sub>x</sub> = \u03C4h/a</i></b></size>\r\n</align>et\r\n<align=center><size=115%><b><i>M<sub>y</sub>
        = \u03C4'h/b</i></b></size>\r\n</align>o\xF9 <b>\u03C4</b> et <b>\u03C4'</b>
        sont des constantes enti\xE8res.\r\nIl en r\xE9sulte que la variation d'angle
        entre les rayons incident et sortant doit satisfaire aux relations suivantes
        :\r\n<align=center><size=115%><b><i>hf/c(cos(\u03B8)-cos(\u03B8')) = \u03C4h/a</i></b>\r\n</size></align>et\r\n<align=center><b><size=115%><i>hf/c(sin(\u03B8)-sin(\u03B8'))
        = \u03C4'h/b</i></b>\r\n</size></align>"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
