      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6504610247994208472, guid: 1f43928e7eb37c04284d31a83a66f4c8,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: texts.Array.data[0]
      value: "4a. <indent=5%>If, as X-rays propagate through the lattice, the momentum
        rule cannot be satisfied for any non-zero integers, then <size=115%><b><i>\u03C4</i></b></size>
        and <size=115%><b><i>\u03C4'</i></b></size> must be zero, no momentum is
        exchanged, and the X-ray remains undeflected."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6504610247994208472, guid: 1f43928e7eb37c04284d31a83a66f4c8,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: texts.Array.data[1]
      value: "<size=110%>4a.<indent=5%> X\u7DDA\u304C\u683C\u5B50\u5185\u3092\u4F1D\u64AD\u3059\u308B\u969B\u3001\u30BC\u30ED\u4EE5\u5916\u306E\u3044\u304B\u306A\u308B\u6574\u6570\u3092\u7528\u3044\u3066\u3082\u904B\u52D5\u91CF\u306B\u95A2\u3059\u308B\u898F\u5247\u3092\u6E80\u305F\u305B\u306A\u3044\u5834\u5408\u3001<size=115%><b><i>\u03C4</i></b></size>\u304A\u3088\u3073<size=115%><b><i>\u03C4'</i></b></size>\u306F\u30BC\u30ED\u3067\u306A\u3051\u308C\u3070\u306A\u3089\u306A\u3044\u3002\u3053\u306E\u3068\u304D\u904B\u52D5\u91CF\u306E\u3084\u308A\u53D6\u308A\u306F\u751F\u3058\u305A\u3001X\u7DDA\u306F\u504F\u5411\u3059\u308B\u3053\u3068\u306A\u304F\u305D\u306E\u307E\u307E\u9032\u3080\u3002"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6504610247994208472, guid: 1f43928e7eb37c04284d31a83a66f4c8,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: texts.Array.data[2]
      value: "<size=110%>4a.<indent=5%> \u5982\u679C X \u5C04\u7DDA\u5728\u6676\u683C\u4E2D\u50B3\u64AD\u6642\uFF0C\u52D5\u91CF\u898F\u5247\u5C0D\u65BC\u4EFB\u4F55\u975E\u96F6\u6574\u6578\u90FD\u4E0D\u80FD\u6EFF\u8DB3\uFF0C\u90A3\u9EBC
        <size=115%><b><i>\u03C4</i></b></size> \u548C <size=115%><b><i>\u03C4'</i></b></size>
        \u4EA4\u63DB\u91CF\u5FC5\u9808\u4FDD\u6301\u4E0D\u65CB\u8F49\uFF0CX\u3002"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6504610247994208472, guid: 1f43928e7eb37c04284d31a83a66f4c8,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: texts.Array.data[3]
      value: "<size=110%>4a.<indent=5%> \u5982\u679C X \u5C04\u7DDA\u5728\u6676\u683C\u4E2D\u50B3\u64AD\u6642\uFF0C\u52D5\u91CF\u898F\u5247\u5C0D\u65BC\u4EFB\u4F55\u975E\u96F6\u6574\u6578\u90FD\u4E0D\u80FD\u6EFF\u8DB3\uFF0C\u90A3\u9EBC
        <size=115%><b><i>\u03C4</i></b></size> \u548C <size=115%><b><i>\u03C4'</i></b></size>
        \u4EA4\u63DB\u91CF\u5FC5\u9808\u4FDD\u6301\u4E0D\u65CB\u8F49\uFF0CX\u3002"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6504610247994208472, guid: 1f43928e7eb37c04284d31a83a66f4c8,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: texts.Array.data[4]
      value: "<size=110%>4a.<indent=5%> X\uC120\uC774 \uACA9\uC790\uB97C \uD1B5\uACFC\uD560
        \uB54C, 0\uC774 \uC544\uB2CC \uC815\uC218\uB4E4\uC5D0 \uB300\uD574\uC11C\uB294
        \uC6B4\uB3D9\uB7C9 \uADDC\uCE59\uC744 \uB9CC\uC871\uC2DC\uD0AC \uC218 \uC5C6\uB2E4\uBA74,
        <size=115%><b><i>\u03C4</i></b></size>\uC640 <size=115%><b><i>\u03C4'</i></b></size>\uB294
        \uBC18\uB4DC\uC2DC 0\uC774 \uB418\uC5B4\uC57C \uD558\uBA70, \uC6B4\uB3D9\uB7C9
        \uAD50\uD658\uC740 \uC77C\uC5B4\uB098\uC9C0 \uC54A\uACE0 X\uC120\uC740 \uAD74\uC808\uB418\uC9C0
        \uC54A\uC740 \uCC44 \uADF8\uB300\uB85C \uC9C4\uD589\uD55C\uB2E4."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6504610247994208472, guid: 1f43928e7eb37c04284d31a83a66f4c8,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: texts.Array.data[5]
      value: "4a. <indent=5%> Se, \xE0 medida que os raios X se propagam atrav\xE9s
        da rede, a regra do momento n\xE3o puder ser satisfeita para quaisquer n\xFAmeros
        inteiros diferentes de zero, ent\xE3o <size=115%><b><i>\u03C4</i></b></size>
        e <size=115%><b><i>\u03C4'</i></b></size> devem ser iguais a zero, nenhum
        momento \xE9 trocado e o raio X permanece sem sofrer desvio."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6504610247994208472, guid: 1f43928e7eb37c04284d31a83a66f4c8,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: texts.Array.data[6]
      value: "4a. <indent=5%> Si, lors de la propagation des rayons X \xE0 travers
        le r\xE9seau, la r\xE8gle relative \xE0 l'impulsion ne peut \xEAtre satisfaite
        pour aucun entier non nul, alors <size=115%><b><i>\u03C4</i></b></size> et
        <size=115%><b><i>\u03C4'</i></b></size> doivent \xEAtre nuls ; aucune impulsion
        n'est \xE9chang\xE9e et le rayon X n'est pas d\xE9vi\xE9."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6504610247994208472, guid: 1f43928e7eb37c04284d31a83a66f4c8,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: serializationData.Prefab
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 6504610247994208472, guid: 1f43928e7eb37c04284d31a83a66f4c8,
        type: 3}
